(7164867, 1099678, 101773, '<td valign="top">I''ve read many comments over the years about folks taking pictures of the homeless, just trying to get a reaction. And whether or not it is exploitation. I''m kind of torn - on one hand, I feel we all need to do more to raise awareness of these poor souls. At the same time, I feel as though we should probably just reach out and help this guy and not take his picture. Would love to hear what you all think. I for one will keep this man in my prayers.</td>', 'I''ve read many comments over the years about folks taking pictures of the homeless, just trying to get a reaction. And whether or not it is exploitation. I''m kind of torn - on one hand, I feel we all need to do more to raise awareness of these poor souls. At the same time, I feel as though we should probably just reach out and help this guy and not take his picture. Would love to hear what you all think. I for one will keep this man in my prayers.', '2014-01-29 10:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
