(7166732, 1100163, 31637, '<td valign="top">Wow...great tonal range, I would rate this an 8 or a 9 but it doesn''t convey cold. :( 6</td>', 'Wow...great tonal range, I would rate this an 8 or a 9 but it doesn''t convey cold. :( 6', '2014-02-01 00:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
