(7168675, 1100194, 173844, '<td valign="top">One of my three highest rated photos.  Here I love how cold is conveyed through delicacy, and a misleading delicacy since these reeds and this tree are so resolute and, therefore, heartening.  The soft colors, too, lead one there and back.</td>', 'One of my three highest rated photos.  Here I love how cold is conveyed through delicacy, and a misleading delicacy since these reeds and this tree are so resolute and, therefore, heartening.  The soft colors, too, lead one there and back.', '2014-02-03 11:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7168679, 1100282, 173844, '<td valign="top">One of my three highest rated photos.  Reminds me of an oriental scroll, read from right to left because of the tree on the left whose form ushers you out.  The snow blowing off the mountaintops also moves you in that direction.  Along the way you can explore up the mountain valley.  A beautiful stroll for the eyes.</td>', 'One of my three highest rated photos.  Reminds me of an oriental scroll, read from right to left because of the tree on the left whose form ushers you out.  The snow blowing off the mountaintops also moves you in that direction.  Along the way you can explore up the mountain valley.  A beautiful stroll for the eyes.', '2014-02-03 12:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
