(7169964, 1100342, 129147, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all of comments. It was a very cold morning and tough not to overexpose this shot. I took many variations, and this is the one I settled on. It was funny that after the re-size, I didn''t care for the moon in the shot (just too small) and the first critique (THANK YOU!) was concerning this. But then again, a couple of you got it!<br/> <br/>Thanks again for all of the comments and especially the critique. <br/> <br/>Some others - <br/> <br/><a href="//flic.kr/p/jE9SUF" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//farm8.staticflickr.com/7446/12246180823_0a5b9dfca8_n.jpg'', strrpos(''//farm8.staticflickr.com/7446/12246180823_0a5b9dfca8_n.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//farm8.staticflickr.com/7446/12246180823_0a5b9dfca8_n.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><a href="//flic.kr/p/jE8YLK" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//farm8.staticflickr.com/7413/12246005435_6e537d6013_n.jpg'', strrpos(''//farm8.staticflickr.com/7413/12246005435_6e537d6013_n.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//farm8.staticflickr.com/7413/12246005435_6e537d6013_n.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><a href="//flic.kr/p/jE9SpH" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//farm3.staticflickr.com/2808/12246179143_e3e26766de_n.jpg'', strrpos(''//farm3.staticflickr.com/2808/12246179143_e3e26766de_n.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//farm3.staticflickr.com/2808/12246179143_e3e26766de_n.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Ken<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-02-05 10:08:50.</i></td>', 'Thank you for all of comments. It was a very cold morning and tough not to overexpose this shot. I took many variations, and this is the one I settled on. It was funny that after the re-size, I didn''t care for the moon in the shot (just too small) and the first critique (THANK YOU!) was concerning this. But then again, a couple of you got it! Thanks again for all of the comments and especially the critique.  Some others -        Ken', '2014-02-05 10:07:32.000000', '2014-02-05 10:08:50.000000', 0),
