(7170219, 1099446, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657241" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657241.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657241.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657241.jpg"/></a> Oo, two xPrizes in a week!  Well done!<br/> <br/>As Don says, two apologies and an excuse.  This image just breathes cold.  The title instantly conjures up leaving my Grandmother''s house on Christmas night, cold and snowy, and my dad rather tipsily trying to stand on one leg to put his rubbers on.  Perfect.</td>', ' Oo, two xPrizes in a week!  Well done! As Don says, two apologies and an excuse.  This image just breathes cold.  The title instantly conjures up leaving my Grandmother''s house on Christmas night, cold and snowy, and my dad rather tipsily trying to stand on one leg to put his rubbers on.  Perfect.', '2014-02-05 15:48:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7170222, 1099545, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657242" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657242.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657242.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657242.jpg"/></a> The x prize is back, ''cause I''m back. These are for the lowest placers of my highest scores: those who wuz robbed... <br/> <br/>This is lovely, but I didn''t see horses until I read the other comments.  I was programmed for cold and snow, so I saw people''s legs in a maelstrom of blowing snow.  I think I like my interpretation more, just ''cause it makes me shiver.  I like your horses too, really...</td>', ' The x prize is back, ''cause I''m back. These are for the lowest placers of my highest scores: those who wuz robbed...  This is lovely, but I didn''t see horses until I read the other comments.  I was programmed for cold and snow, so I saw people''s legs in a maelstrom of blowing snow.  I think I like my interpretation more, just ''cause it makes me shiver.  I like your horses too, really...', '2014-02-05 15:54:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7170224, 1099710, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg"/></a> The x prize is back, ''cause I''m back. These are for the lowest placers of my highest scores: those who wuz robbed... <br/> <br/>O, this is just stunning.  Quiet, dark, and controlled, with no obvious signifiers of cold, yet the overall impression is of chill.  Not deeply frigid, just a chill.  Too cold for inside.</td>', ' The x prize is back, ''cause I''m back. These are for the lowest placers of my highest scores: those who wuz robbed...  O, this is just stunning.  Quiet, dark, and controlled, with no obvious signifiers of cold, yet the overall impression is of chill.  Not deeply frigid, just a chill.  Too cold for inside.', '2014-02-05 15:58:12.000000', NULL, 0),
