(7193947, 1100185, 171792, '<td valign="top">Thank you so much, I''m very happy for the Top Ten in early ... <br/>Given the theme, I figured that most of the photographs in the competition would have been winter landscapes. <br/>I wanted to propose an original photograph and different. <br/>I froze a little water to get a slab of ice, then I asked my wife to keep her in front of his eyes. <br/>The problem I faced is that the ice in the freezer is not transparent but white, to refine the layer of ice where I was interested in I used a hairdrier to vary the thickness. <br/> <br/>Thanks for the votes, for their comments and for appreciating the photos, I''m happy!</td>', 'Thank you so much, I''m very happy for the Top Ten in early ... Given the theme, I figured that most of the photographs in the competition would have been winter landscapes. I wanted to propose an original photograph and different. I froze a little water to get a slab of ice, then I asked my wife to keep her in front of his eyes. The problem I faced is that the ice in the freezer is not transparent but white, to refine the layer of ice where I was interested in I used a hairdrier to vary the thickness.  Thanks for the votes, for their comments and for appreciating the photos, I''m happy!', '2014-03-25 20:08:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7194264, 1100185, 30861, '<td valign="top">Outstanding image, Angelo!</td>', 'Outstanding image, Angelo!', '2014-03-26 11:35:52.000000', NULL, 0),
